Package: daos
Title: Utility Functions for Statistical Work
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Daniel", "Madsen", email = "danielmadsen@live.dk",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A collection of utility functions for day-to-day statistical
    work. Includes helpers for file I/O across many formats, duplicate
    detection, column type comparison, Danish identifier cleaning, register spell and panel data, interactive
    time-series screening, and various convenience shortcuts for common
    tidyverse patterns. The data validation checkpoints have moved to the
    expectr package; daos forwards them for existing scripts.
